//
// The REAL suite trigger (@P393) — the two `03-text.loft` shapes that turn the
// `wrap text` + `wrap loft_suite` leak gate red.  `split` (02_files.loft:133) is
// a loop+trailing builder (probe 03's shape) → de-NRVO'd → its inline-unbound
// result leaks on the interpreter.  `SCRIPTS_LEAK_ALLOW` is empty, so the gate
// fails the file.
//
// This is the minimized stand-in for 03-text; it is what the fix must turn green.
//
// Expected (today):  interp = LEAK   native = clean
// Expected (post-fix): clean on both backends.

fn main() {
  n = len("x-y-z".split('-'));            // split result as a call argument
  r = "x-y-z".split('-').join("-");       // split result as a method receiver
  println("n={n} r={r}");
}
